# 止蝕
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺投資或者生意入面，為咗避免損失繼續擴大，而主動賣出或者停止虧損嘅項目（量詞：次）
eng:to cut losses; to stop loss
<eg>
yue:佢見到隻股票跌得好急，就決定止蝕離場。 (keoi5 gin3 dou2 zek3 gu2 piu3 dit3 dak1 hou2 gap1, zau6 kyut3 ding6 zi2 sik6 lei4 coeng4.)
eng:Seeing the stock plummeting, he decided to cut his losses and exit the market. [end of text]


